<refentry id="SQL-SELECTINTO">
 <refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>
SELECT INTO
  </refentrytitle>
  <refmiscinfo>SQL - 语言语句</refmiscinfo>
 </refmeta>
 <refnamediv>
  <refname>
SELECT INTO
  </refname>
  <refpurpose>
   从一个现有的表或视图创建一个新表
  </refpurpose></refnamediv>
 <refsynopsisdiv>
  <refsynopsisdivinfo>
   <date>1998-09-22</date>
  </refsynopsisdivinfo>
  <synopsis>
SELECT [ ALL | DISTINCT ] <replaceable class="PARAMETER">expression</replaceable> [ AS <replaceable class="PARAMETER">name</replaceable> ] [, ...]
    INTO [TEMP] [ TABLE ] <replaceable class="PARAMETER">new_table</replaceable> ]
    [ FROM <replaceable class="PARAMETER">table</replaceable> [<replaceable class="PARAMETER">alias</replaceable>] [, ...] ]
    [ WHERE <replaceable class="PARAMETER">condition</replaceable> ]
    [ GROUP BY <replaceable class="PARAMETER">column</replaceable> [, ...] ]
    [ HAVING <replaceable class="PARAMETER">condition</replaceable> [, ...] ]
    [ { UNION [ALL] | INTERSECT | EXCEPT } <replaceable class="PARAMETER">select</replaceable>]
    [ ORDER BY <replaceable class="PARAMETER">column</replaceable> [ ASC | DESC ] [, ...] ]
    [ FOR UPDATE [OF class_name...]]
    [ LIMIT count [OFFSET|, count]]
  </synopsis>
  
  <refsect2 id="R2-SQL-SELECTINTO-1">
   <refsect2info>
    <date>1998-09-22</date>
   </refsect2info>
   <title>
    输入
   </title>
   <para>
所有输入字段在 SELECT 中有详细描述。
   </para>
  </refsect2>

  <refsect2 id="R2-SQL-SELECTINTO-2">
   <refsect2info>
    <date>1998-09-22</date>
   </refsect2info>
   <title>
    输出
   </title>
   <para>
所有输出字段在 SELECT 中有详细描述。
   </para>
  </refsect2>
 </refsynopsisdiv>

 <refsect1 id="R1-SQL-SELECTINTO-1">
  <refsect1info>
   <date>1998-09-22</date>
  </refsect1info>
  <title>描述</title>
  <para>
   <command>SELECT INTO</command> 从查询的
   结果创建一个新表。通常这个
   查询从现有的表提取数据，但允许任何
   SQL 查询。
   <note>
	<para>
	 <command>CREATE TABLE AS</command> 在功能上等价于
	 <command>SELECT INTO</command> 命令。
	</para>
   </note>
  </para>
 </refsect1>
</refentry>

